---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---
<Base title="About Southwala" description="Who is behind Southwala and what we cover.">
  <div class="page">
    <h1>About Southwala</h1>
    <p>Southwala is a South India-first news and culture site for people who grew up on Instagram reels, filter coffee and fan wars. We cover politics, movies, TV and OTT, and the internet moments that everyone is talking about, across Tamil Nadu, Kerala, Karnataka, Andhra Pradesh and Telangana.</p>
    <h2>How we work</h2>
    <p>Southwala runs as an AI-assisted newsroom with a human editor. AI helps us watch the news, summarise it and draft stories quickly. Every story follows our <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a>, cites its sources, and politically sensitive stories are checked by a human before they go live.</p>
    <h2>Why we exist</h2>
    <p>Most South India coverage is either too serious to share or too shallow to trust. We want to be the page you open to understand what happened, why it matters, and what people are saying, in two minutes.</p>
    <h2>Talk to us</h2>
    <p>Tips, corrections, complaints and collaborations: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
